    "isUbdIssue": true,
    "issueTitle": "Test UBD Verification Issue",
    "issueDescription": "ActiveX initialized successfully for Zone 2. Test diagnostic report.",
    "aiAnalysis": "### 1. Root Cause Analysis (సమస్య మూల కారణాలు)\n\n* **Document Mode Mismatch (IE5 Quirks Mode):** Edge IE Mode is currently running in **IE5 Quirks Mode**. Most NIC/Telangana portal DSC scripts require **IE10 or IE11 Standards Mode**; running in IE5 Quirks mode breaks the JavaScript/ActiveX APIs required to communicate with the DSC token.\n* **DSC Token Communication Failure:** The system indicates `DSC Token Status: Not Detected`. This occurs when:\n  * The Token driver (ePass2003, mToken, ProxKey) is either not installed, corrupted, or running 32-bit/64-bit incompatible middleware.\n  * The Windows **Smart Card** background service (`SCardSvr`) is stopped or disabled.\n  * The physical USB token is loose or connected to a faulty USB port.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Immediate Fix for Computer Operator (తక్షణ పరిష్కార మార్గాలు)\n\n1. **Fix Edge IE Mode Emulation:**\n   * Open the UBD portal in Microsoft Edge.\n   * Press **F12** to open Developer Tools.\n   * Go to the **Emulation** tab (or document mode selector) and change the **Document Mode** from *5 (Quirks)* to **10** or **11 (Default)**.\n   * *Alternative (Permanent):* In Edge Enterprise Site List configuration, set the document mode for the portal to `<open-in>IE11</open-in>`.\n\n2. **Check & Restart Smart Card Service:**\n   * Press `Windows Key + R`, type `services.msc`, and press **Enter**.\n   * Locate **Smart Card**.\n   * Ensure **Startup Type** is set to **Automatic**, then right-click and select **Restart** (or **Start**).\n\n3. **Reinstall / Verify DSC Middleware:**\n   * Unplug the DSC USB Token.\n   * Open *Control Panel > Programs and Features*. Verify if the token software (e.g., **ePass2003 India PKI**, **mToken**, or **ProxKey**) is installed.\n   * Re-insert the token into a **rear USB port** (direct to motherboard, avoid front panel or USB hubs).\n   * Open the token manager software to confirm the certificate is visible inside the token.\n\n4. **Verify Trusted Sites & ActiveX:**\n   * Go to `inetcpl.cpl` (Internet Options) > **Security** > **Trusted Sites**.\n   * Confirm the portal URL is added.\n   * Under **Custom Level**, ensure **ActiveX controls and plug-ins** are set to *Enable* or *Prompt*.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Telugu Summary (గ్రామ పంచాయతీ సిబ్బంది కోసం తెలుగులో సూచన)\n\n1. **టోకెన్ (DSC) గుర్తించకపోవడం:** కంప్యూటర్‌లో వేసిన DSC Dongle (ePass2003 / mToken) డ్రైవర్ సరిగ్గా పనిచేయడం లేదు. డోంగిల్‌ను తీసి కంప్యూటర్ వెనుక ఉండే USB పోర్ట్‌కు పెట్టండి. అవసరమైతే DSC Token సాఫ్ట్‌వేర్‌ను మళ్లీ ఇన్‌స్టాల్ చేయండి.\n2. **స్మార్ట్ కార్డ్ సర్వీస్ (Smart Card Service):** `services.msc` లోకి వెళ్లి \"Smart Card\" సర్వీస్ **Running** లో ఉందో లేదో చూసి **Restart** చేయండి.\n3. **Edge బ్రౌజర్ సెట్టింగ్:** మైక్రోసాఫ్ట్ ఎడ్జ్ బ్రౌజర్ **IE5 Quirks Mode** లో ఓపెన్ అవుతోంది. **F12** బటన్ నొక్కి Document Mode ని **IE 10 లేదా IE 11** కు మార్చండి.\n4. ఈ మార్పులు చేసిన తర్వాత బ్రౌజర్‌ను పూర్తిగా క్లోజ్ చేసి, తిరిగి ఓపెన్ చేసి UBD పోర్టల్‌లో లాగిన్ అవ్వండి.",
    "githubIssueUrl": "https://github.com/Rakeshkumardhawan/UBDTOOLS/issues/new?title=%5BUBD-ISSUE%5D%20Test%20UBD%20Verification%20Issue%20(GP-WARANGAL-01%20-%20Hanamkonda%20Grama%20Panchayat)&body=%23%23%23%20%F0%9F%96%A5%EF%B8%8F%20Machine%20Environment%20%26%20Office%20Details%0A-%20**Office%20Location**%3A%20Hanamkonda%20Grama%20Panchayat%0A-%20**PC%20%2F%20Machine%20Name**%3A%20%60GP-WARANGAL-01%60%0A-%20**User%20Account**%3A%20%60Operator%60%0A-%20**Windows%20OS**%3A%20Windows%2010%2F11%0A-%20**DSC%20Token%20Status**%3A%20Not%20Detected%0A-%20**Edge%20IE%20Mode**%3A%20IE5%20Quirks%20Mode%0A%0A%23%23%23%20%E2%9A%A0%EF%B8%8F%20UBD%20Website%20%2F%20Error%20Description%0AActiveX%20initialized%20successfully%20for%20Zone%202.%20Test%20diagnostic%20report.%0A%0A%23%23%23%20%F0%9F%93%8B%20Diagnostic%20%26%20Error%20Log%0A%60%60%60%0ANo%20logs%20captured.%0A%60%60%60%0A%0A%23%23%23%20%F0%9F%A4%96%20Google%20AI%20Studio%20Diagnostic%20Report%0A%23%23%23%201.%20Root%20Cause%20Analysis%20(%E0%B0%B8%E0%B0%AE%E0%B0%B8%E0%B1%8D%E0%B0%AF%20%E0%B0%AE%E0%B1%82%E0%B0%B2%20%E0%B0%95%E0%B0%BE%E0%B0%B0%E0%B0%A3%E0%B0%BE%E0%B0%B2%E0%B1%81)%0A%0A*%20**Document%20Mode%20Mismatch%20(IE5%20Quirks%20Mode)%3A**%20Edge%20IE%20Mode%20is%20currently%20running%20in%20**IE5%20Quirks%20Mode**.%20Most%20NIC%2FTelangana%20portal%20DSC%20scripts%20require%20**IE10%20or%20IE11%20Standards%20Mode**%3B%20running%20in%20IE5%20Quirks%20mode%20breaks%20the%20JavaScript%2FActiveX%20APIs%20required%20to%20communicate%20with%20the%20DSC%20token.%0A*%20**DSC%20Token%20Communication%20Failure%3A**%20The%20system%20indicates%20%60DSC%20Token%20Status%3A%20Not%20Detected%60.%20This%20occurs%20when%3A%0A%20%20*%20The%20Token%20driver%20(ePass2003%2C%20mToken%2C%20ProxKey)%20is%20either%20not%20installed%2C%20corrupted%2C%20or%20running%2032-bit%2F64-bit%20incompatible%20middleware.%0A%20%20*%20The%20Windows%20**Smart%20Card**%20background%20service%20(%60SCardSvr%60)%20is%20stopped%20or%20disabled.%0A%20%20*